pageType: content
background:
  type: image
  src: "media/template-inner.png"
  fit: {mode: cover}
elements:
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [58, 44, 820, 48]
    content:
      style: "$title"
      text: 需求二｜额度治理与运行状态协调
  - elementId: lead
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 100, 840, 30]
    content:
      style: "$subtitle"
      text: 以成本或 Token 作为统一度量，将默认规则、Key 级覆盖、超限动作和上游状态纳入同一治理链路。
  - elementId: c1
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 158, 250, 174]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$pale"}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$blue"}
  - elementId: c1t
    elementType: text
    bounds: [78, 180, 214, 132]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      text: |
        <p><strong>度量模型</strong></p>
        <p>支持 cost / tokens 两种模式，统一日、周窗口与失败请求处理口径。</p>
  - elementId: c2
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [355, 158, 250, 174]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$red"}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$red"}
  - elementId: c2t
    elementType: text
    bounds: [373, 180, 214, 132]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      color: "$white"
      text: |
        <p><strong>策略模型</strong></p>
        <p>默认限额优先，Key override 覆盖；超限动作包括 pause、downgrade、notify。</p>
  - elementId: c3
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [650, 158, 250, 174]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$pale"}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$blue"}
  - elementId: c3t
    elementType: text
    bounds: [668, 180, 214, 132]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      text: |
        <p><strong>可靠性边界</strong></p>
        <p>上游暂停状态不可确认时，不执行猜测性暂停或恢复；状态变化保留 reason 与 expires_at。</p>
  - elementId: flow
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 380, 840, 58]
    content:
      fontSize: 20
      bold: true
      color: "$ink"
      align: [center, middle]
      text: 用量事实 → 成本 / Token 计算 → 策略匹配 → 治理动作 → 状态同步
  - elementId: source
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 474, 840, 20]
    content:
      style: "$bodySmall"
      fontSize: 11
      text: 相关功能：额度策略、Key 级覆盖、暂停 / 降级 / 告警、CPA 状态同步与异常保护。
